	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be present on zendesk.liferay.com
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	When I wait for "60" seconds
