	| End Date                | ${staticFutureEndDate}         | |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticFutureOriginalEndDate} | |
	| Perpetual               | false                          | |
	| Start Date              | ${staticFutureStartDate}       | |
	| Status                  | Approved                       | |
	And I synchronize the account entitlement definition with the name "Gold Subscription"
	Then the ticket with ticketId "${staticRequestIdList}" should have the status "closed"
	And the ticket with ticketId "${staticRequestIdList}" should have the default user from the organization with the name "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}" as the requester
